<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53254" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρᾰβ-ος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[κᾱ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ο</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>horned</i> or
				<i>cerambycid beetle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				531b25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				551b17
			</span></i> (with vv.ll. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καράβιοι,
			καράμβιοι</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a prickly crustacean, <i>crayfish</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				318.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.313
			</span></i>, etc.: disted. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρκίνος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				684a1
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>HA</u>
				525b32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				590b20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαλακόστρακος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				490b11
			</span></i>, cf. Specus. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.105b
			</span></i>; an Eastern species, <i><span class="en">
				Nearch.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				29.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> a <i>light
				ship,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				EM
				490.31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>VI.</b>
			<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>, <i>gate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
